WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:07.770
Laughing so hard that no noise comes out is
actually good for your health.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:18.000
It reduces your risk of heart disease.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.140
About one in every 4 million lobsters is born
with a rare genetic defect that turns it blue.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:28.939
And one in every 30 million lobsters is yellow.

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:34.880
The Mimic Octopus doesn't just change colour
it can also mimic the shapes of other sea

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.680
creatures like the lionfish and sea snakes.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:43.800
The left lung is smaller than the right lung
to make room for the heart.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:51.780
The original surveyors of Mount Everest lied
and added 2 feet to its height to make it

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.070
29,002 feet.

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:59.879
Because they didn't think people would believe
them if they said it was really 29,000 feet

00:00:59.879 --> 00:01:01.059
high.

00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:07.890
Bacteria can get viruses and viruses can also
get viruses.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:13.970
The Canadian University of Victoria offers
a course in the science of Batman.

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:20.950
The United States, Liberia and Burma are the
only countries in the world that have not

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:26.450
officially adopted the metric system as their
standard of measurement.

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:33.270
Seahorses form monogamous lifetime relationships
and travel in pairs, holding each other's

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.270
tails.

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:40.980
A fortunate two percent of the population
have a genetic variation that doesn't cause

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:44.290
any body odour when they sweat.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:50.880
Ashton Kutcher tried Steve Job's fruitarian
diet when getting into character for the JOBS

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:57.790
movies and ended up in hospital because it
seriously messed up his pancreas levels.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:01.420
Steve Jobs died of Pancreatic Cancer.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:08.080
99% of all the species that have ever lived
are now extinct.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:14.269
The praying mantis has only one ear, which
is located between its legs.

00:02:14.269 --> 00:02:21.359
Modern homing pigeons find it easier to follow
motorways and turn left and right at junctions

00:02:21.359 --> 00:02:25.909
instead of using their in-built navigational
abilities.

00:02:25.909 --> 00:02:31.629
More than one in five Americans believes that
the world will end in their lifetime.

00:02:31.629 --> 00:02:40.249
Wars kill more civilians than soldiers: in
a war, the safest place to be is usually in

00:02:40.249 --> 00:02:42.339
the army.

